---
layout: base.njk
title: Blog
description: Longer notes on research topics—code, math, and occasional interactive snippets.
---
<h1>Blog</h1>
<p class="lede">Research notes and essays that suit a web format better than a full publication entry. <a href="{{ '/feed.xml' | url }}">RSS feed</a></p>

<ul class="blog-list">
  {% for post in collections.posts | sortPosts %}
  <li class="blog-list-item">
    <a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a>
    {% if post.data.date %}<time class="blog-list-date" datetime="{{ post.data.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.data.date | readableDate }}</time>{% endif %}
    {% if post.data.description %}<p class="blog-list-desc">{{ post.data.description }}</p>{% endif %}
  </li>
  {% endfor %}
</ul>
